.TH QUOTACTL 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
quotactl \- invokes the linux quota control syscall using command-specific data and privileges
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/syscall_extra.h>
.B int quotactl(int command, const char* special, int id, void* address);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Invokes the Linux quota control syscall using command-specific data and privileges.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR quotactl (2)
